[ti:Inside My Head]
[ar:Mippithedork]
[offset:-500]

[00:08.56]Yeah...
[00:16.08]Whatever...
[00:24.67]Got a million-dollar vision
[00:26.92]Got it buried in my brain
[00:28.78]Everybody wants a document
[00:30.92]Everybody sounds the same
[00:32.95]Got a meeting in the morning
[00:34.97]Got a question every night
[00:37.05]They keep asking for direction
[00:39.07]Like they can't tell wrong from right
[00:41.07]You want a plan
[00:43.08]You want a page
[00:45.17]You want a box
[00:47.07]To build my cage
[00:48.82]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[00:50.91]DON'T NEED YOU TO QUESTION ME!
[00:53.00]IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE INSIDE MY HEAD!
[00:54.81]JUST BUILD THE THING I NEVER SAID!
[00:57.08]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[00:59.20]QUIT TRYING TO PUT YOUR RULES ON ME!
[01:01.67]YOU WANT A PLAN,
[01:02.79]YOU WANT A SIGN
[01:03.68]JUST MAKE THE GAME I HAVE IN MY MIND!
[01:14.31]Artist wants a reference
[01:16.46]Coder wants a spec
[01:18.54]Designer wants the numbers
[01:20.47]Producer wants a check
[01:22.66]I told 'em make it faster
[01:24.31]Now they say it's way too slow
[01:26.60]I told 'em make it darker
[01:28.39]They should know how dark to go
[01:30.43]You want the truth
[01:32.38]You want it clear
[01:34.44]I said it once
[01:36.40]Some time last year
[01:38.84]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[01:40.24]DON'T NEED YOU TO QUESTION ME!
[01:42.21]IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE INSIDE MY HEAD!
[01:44.19]JUST BUILD THE THING I NEVER SAID!
[01:46.36]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[01:48.39]QUIT TRYING TO PUT YOUR RULES ON ME!
[01:50.84]YOU WANT A PLAN,
[01:51.92]YOU WANT A SIGN
[01:52.88]JUST MAKE THE GAME I HAVE IN MY MIND!
[02:02.69]They built what I asked for
[02:06.36]Now they're acting all surprised
[02:10.55]I told 'em that's the old game
[02:14.60]Can't they see the vision's died?
[02:19.06]They showed me all the messages
[02:23.05]The things I used to say
[02:27.48]I told 'em that's called progress
[02:31.21]Things are different every day
[02:36.47]You write it down
[02:38.01]You make it law
[02:40.03]You kill the dream
[02:42.12]Before it draws
[02:44.35]Three different versions
[02:46.36]Of a game nobody knows
[02:48.31]Three different answers
[02:50.88]Everywhere the question goes
[02:52.27]What are we making?
[02:54.39]What are we making?
[02:56.41]Why can't you see it?
[02:58.45]Why can't you see?
[03:00.49]WHAT ARE WE MAKING?
[03:02.58]WHAT ARE WE MAKING?
[03:04.67]IT'S RIGHT IN FRONT OF ME!
[03:25.97]No paper!
[03:26.81]No rules!
[03:27.75]No meetings!
[03:28.78]No fools!
[03:29.82]No roadmap!
[03:30.83]No plan!
[03:31.89]No questions!
[03:32.91]JUST DO WHAT I SAID!
[03:37.43]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[03:39.28]DON'T NEED YOU TO QUESTION ME!
[03:41.35]IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE INSIDE MY HEAD!
[03:43.21]JUST BUILD THE THING I NEVER SAID!
[03:45.45]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[03:47.43]QUIT TRYING TO PUT YOUR RULES ON ME!
[03:49.94]YOU WANT A PLAN,
[03:51.03]YOU WANT A SIGN
[03:51.86]JUST MAKE THE GAME I HAVE IN MY MIND!
[04:00.11]Look, we just need something written down.
[04:05.93]Nobody knows what we're making anymore.
[04:11.08]Fine.
[04:17.27]Somebody write down what's in my head.
